Summary Views
The Summary View (NetsitesViewSummary, NetSitesViewSummResp) provides a
consolidated, at-a-glance snapshot of a contract's current state, including:
- Contract identification details (number, site, region)
- Current lease term and execution status
- Active payment term summary (current rent, frequency, next due date)
- Renewal/option term status and upcoming exercise deadlines
- Outstanding QC audit status
- Recent document activity
This view is the primary landing page for a Real Estate Manager reviewing a specific site
